    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαργᾰλ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tickling</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλως διὰ κινήσεως τοῦ μορίου τοῦ
					περὶ τὴν μασχάλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					673a8
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Alim.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				189a
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				253e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				412
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ σώματι διέδραμε γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hegesipp.
					1.16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονὴ γαργαλισμοῦ ἐφίεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.118
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				212
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.765c
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάργαλος</span></b> , ὁ (more 
				Att.
			 acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Moer.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				133
			</span></i>), and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαργάλη</span></b> , ἡ, are cited by <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαργαλισμός</span>
			, fr. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				175
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				25
			</span></i>.</div>
